---
// Ambient background: six soft colour blobs (far / mid / near) rising,
// falling and swelling slowly behind the page (see `.lava` in global.css).
// Purely decorative.
---

<div class="lava" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="lava-blob lava-blob-1"></span>
  <span class="lava-blob lava-blob-2"></span>
  <span class="lava-blob lava-blob-3"></span>
  <span class="lava-blob lava-blob-4"></span>
  <span class="lava-blob lava-blob-5"></span>
  <span class="lava-blob lava-blob-6"></span>
</div>
